								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1343.msg13467#msg13467">Re: You know that EQ ended, right?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #46 on:</b> December 30, 2004, 12:32:15 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
