							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1343.msg13446#msg13446">Quote from: Lhyra on December 29, 2004, 02:51:50 pm</a></div><div class="quote"><div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1343.msg13445#msg13445">Quote from: umbrella on December 29, 2004, 02:32:26 pm</a></div><div class="quote"> i am a die hard coh fanboy</div><br />You should have left this out.&nbsp; It destroyed your credibility.<br /></div><br />you speak as if i gave a shit what you think<br /><br />and for the record i wasn&#039;t really excited about WoW at all and wasnt even planning on getting it<br /><br />call me spoiled but i like games that i actually have fun in
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
