					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg13484"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=236" title="View the profile of Gonaiel">Gonaiel</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Splitpaw Gnoll<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 94<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/demon1.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								I&#039;m a llama!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=236"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1343.msg13484#msg13484"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1343.msg13484#msg13484">Re: You know that EQ ended, right?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #55 on:</b> December 31, 2004, 04:22:42 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							9 out 10 players that are flaged for certain zones are going to be better then desenct players.&nbsp; There is the exception to the rule though.&nbsp; If you have flags or keys and have quests or what not you have to do or finsh before you can get access to the zone then you will have better quality players in the zones while the crappy people are left to the outside looking in.&nbsp; with some zones its more gear/skill then skill alone.&nbsp; If you don&#039;t have the mana to keep up with the damage the tank is taking then you proble dont belong in that zone or if your getting waxed as a tank with a good healer with good mana you proble dont belong in the zone.&nbsp; I have not said one thing about guild tags in my last 2 post so I don&#039;t know where you would think thats what im talking about.&nbsp; Makwe the flag quests/key quests 1 groupable to raid lvl depending on the zone.<br /><br />They need to ajust the raid mins a little lower so more people wont lose intrest.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
