						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1343.msg13493#msg13493"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1343.msg13493#msg13493">Re: You know that EQ ended, right?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #57 on:</b> January 02, 2005, 11:31:22 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							&nbsp;First off..<br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote"> &quot; Also, this is the rant&#039;s and raves section, I think the &quot;omg, quit ripping EQ/complaining/mathematically proving WoW is better then EQ&quot; comments should stop.&quot; </div> <br /><br />I agree, WoW maybe better than EQ in the hard fact, but its all just a matter of opinion.<br /><br />If EQ Ended, why are there still 200+ people in Bazaar at almost any given time?&nbsp; Yep. Sure there was a population decrease, but it doesn&#039;t meant the games over.&nbsp; <br />
						</td>
					</tr>
